Files derived from rift:

  Copied with minimal changes (import paths, helpers used only by unported
  modules removed or made test-only, ScreenId renamed DisplayId):
    src/sys/{app,axuielement,cocoa,dispatch,display_link,enhanced_ui,event,
             event_tap,executor,geometry,observer,power,process,run_loop,timer}.rs
    src/actor/mod.rs
    src/actor/app.rs
    src/actor/reactor/transaction_manager.rs
    src/model/tx_store.rs
    src/common/collections.rs

  Derived (trimmed to window create/destroy/reorder notifications; space ids
  in payloads are skipped, never stored or queried):
    src/sys/window_notify.rs

  Modified (native Space support removed):
    src/sys/screen.rs        display enumeration only; space queries removed
    src/sys/skylight.rs      space FFI declarations removed
    src/sys/window_server.rs space-scoped window queries removed
    src/actor/reactor/animation.rs
                             presenter keyed by DisplayId instead of SpaceId;
                             viewport-camera motion removed; layout entry points
                             take a PresenterHost instead of rift's Reactor

rift's src/sys/skylight.rs credits private-API declarations to
https://github.com/asmagill/hs._asm.undocumented.spaces and
https://github.com/koekeishiya/yabai.
